res appeared in the city and the vampire hunter Blitz \"Lucky\" Abrahms arrives to assist them.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/289886/5183303.jpg"},{"title":"The Tremorous Blood Hammer","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10663","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20727","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24439","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"62327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"289886","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"109215","synopsis":"Aligura, the Queen of Monomania, is on the hunt to find her creation, Brody & Hummer, and her monster truck is tearing up anything that gets in her way! Meanwhile, Femt and the King of Despair make some secret plans of their own.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/289886/5183304.jpg"},{"title":"Don`t Forget to Don`t Forget Me","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10663","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20727","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24439","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"62327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"289886","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"109216","synopsis":"While out buying lunch for Zapp and himself, Leo befriends a mushroom-like Beyondian named Nej, who has a craving for hamburgers, but is unable to buy them from the segregated 42nd Street quarter where they are sold.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/289886/5183305.jpg"},{"title":"A No-Holds-Barred Eden","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10663","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20727","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24439","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"62327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"289886","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"109217","synopsis":"Chasing down a rescue request from Zapp, Klaus and Leo find themselves in an underground cage-fighting arena, with Klaus winding up in the ring. Black and Leo hit it off over lunch at the diner, and learn that they have much in common.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/289886/5201409.jpg"},{"title":"Z`s Longest Day (Part 1)","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10663","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20727","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24439","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"62327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"289886","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"109218","synopsis":"As Zapp's profligate lifestyle starts catching up with him, word comes in that a Blood Breed attack is coming to Hellsalem's Lot, but that someone outside of Libra is also involved. Black speaks to White about their relationship with Leo.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/289886/5201411.jpg"},{"title":"Z`s Longest Day (Part 2)","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10663","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20727","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24439","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"62327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"289886","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"109219","synopsis":"While a crowd looks on, an airplane attempting to fly into Hellsalem's